st reloading.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Greatly increases reload speed"},{"name":"Light Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/736b486ddb80beefacb4f09b5ad016eb.png","desc":"Improved reload and range.\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Phase Magazine","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a51d91da9fb0a4c8f45b2ffa89e51ad7.png","desc":"Increases damage while lowering rate of fire.\n  •  Decreases magazine size"}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Under Pressure","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ac8ec81cd8139434a4b19e459bd9b8ff.png","desc":"Improved stability and accuracy as the magazine gets lower."},{"name":"Zen Moment","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9650a58cd3a439bf3b53a53dbc8122a0.png","desc":"Causing damage with this weapon reduces recoil and flinch over time."},{"name":"Killing Wind","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/db2aa71ff6d808929bb0e668dcf0822e.png","desc":"Final blows grant increased mobility, weapon range, and handling for a short duration."},{"name":"Surplus","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a4c054c3547840300b9ce7ef11b7b6fc.png","desc":"Increases handling, reload speed, and stability for each fully charged ability."},{"name":"Ambitious Assassin","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/1f93b49c7f10b1be70083f913a3c5d63.png","desc":"Overflows the magazine based on the number of rapid kills before reloading."},{"name":"Feeding Frenzy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/89d7e65f5ebe8d291ea96f128765921d.png","desc":"Each rapid kill with this weapon progressively increases reload speed for a short time."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Unrelenting","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/1e5843177c71ae3f2a4770d01a2f3813.png","desc":"Rapidly defeating targets triggers health regeneration. Guardians and powerful combatants count as more than one kill."},{"name":"Dragonfly","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/c87b03bb6d56b393f8582e128b337332.png","des